role Caps.Cap_Set_Service : Caps.Bank_Constructor;
--  The userland cap set server's Bank_Constructor (#825, #849), which
--  makes sets with Create, as a Constructor, or in a bank with Create_In.
--  Run_Self_Tests has it, for the tests of cap sets: init gives it. The
--  replaceable servers have it for their handovers (#831). Petal gives
--  none, and a command must work without it.
